  "summary": "Adds a unit test in `fs_tests` verifying that `std::filesystem::copy_file` with `copy_options::overwrite_existing` successfully overwrites an existing file. This tests for an upstream libstdc++ bug on Windows where `copy_file` throws a \"File exists\" error despite the overwrite flag.",
